{
  "uid": "storage-baseline",
  "title": "Storage / Load & Bottlenecks",
  "tags": [
    "storage",
    "baseline"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "node",
        "label": "PU",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": "label_values(storage_requests_total{role=\"pu\"}, node)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "window",
        "label": "Rate window",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "30s,1m,2m,5m",
        "current": {
          "text": "30s",
          "value": "30s"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "01 / Experiment overview",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Client → Router → PU → PostgreSQL** · Compare uniform and hot-partition runs, then database-lock pressure. **Pool wait ≠ database execution.** PostgreSQL waits/locks/I/O provide bottleneck evidence. Missing telemetry stays **No data**. Updates perform a GET before the conditional write; offered rate counts iterations, HTTP throughput counts requests."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
